  shopkeeperName: Fletcher
  bowAndArrowsCost: 45
  arrowRefillCost: 5
  greetingDialogue: A hatchling will need meat, and you will need a steady hand.
    I can sell you a bow and a bundle of arrows.
  purchasePrompt: Press E again to buy the bow and arrows.
  purchasedDialogue: Good. Keep the string dry, and do not waste your arrows.
  refillGreetingDialogue: Back already? I can sell you another bundle of arrows.
  refillPrompt: Press E again to buy more arrows.
  refillPurchasedDialogue: Here is another bundle. Make these shots count.
  alreadyOwnedDialogue: You already have a bow and arrows. Use them wisely.
  notEnoughGoldDialogue: You do not have enough gold for the bow and arrows.
